	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Diu certe nullas ad te literas dedi, dilecte frater, nullam <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>aliam ob caussam, quam quod constanter <persName>Lucius</persName>, quoties ipsum <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>amandassem, asseverabat neminem <placeName ref="l648">Rhetorum</placeName> venisse ad <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nundinas, cui tuto potuissent credi literae.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Et cum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/><persName>Thomannus</persName>, questor urbis ęrarius contenderet <placeName ref="l968">Rapperschvylum</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>ad comitia, tradidi ei, quae nunc mitto nova; etenim <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>existimabam ipsum ad vos usque profecturum; sed re<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>diit mox et reddidit accepta.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Comitia indicta quidem <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>sunt a nostris, sed postulantibus <placeName ref="l646">Glaronensibus</placeName>, unde et legatus <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>ad vos missus est <placeName ref="l646">Glaronen[sis]</placeName> d. <persName>Hessius</persName> idque omnium <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>aliorum cantonum nomine.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Quae autem nunc mitto <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>nova, remittas ad nos per proximum nuncium.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Interim <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>communicabis dominis et fratribus d. <persName ref="p3958">Willio</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>d. <persName ref="p8057">Campello</persName>, d. <persName ref="p1770">Gregorio</persName> capitaneo caeterisque fidis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Ex <lb xml:id="p1z15"/><placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> accepi literas a 3 episcopis et senatore ac mercatore <lb xml:id="p1z16"/><placeName ref="l296">Londiniensi</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Scribunt illi suas mense februario: <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>in <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> et <placeName ref="l2524">Scotia</placeName> omnia esse pacatissima; non memin<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ere ullius belli contra <placeName ref="l832">Gallum</placeName> suscepti.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Certam<lb xml:id="p1z19"/>ina vigere inter illos partim a papistis, partim <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>ab anabaptistis; papistas fortiter cohercere reginam, <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>anabaptistas confundi a doctoribus.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">[Co]mitia [re]gni <persName>Angli[ci]</persName> magna [cel]<lb xml:id="p1z22"/>ebrabuntur 1. aprilis.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la">Complures aliae ad me ex variis adferuntur locis, sed nihil memorabil<lb xml:id="p1z23"/>e continentes, nisi haec ipsa, quae in novis illis <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>comprehenduntur, ea confirmantur.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">Additur 14. aprilis in <placeName ref="l2472">Polonia</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>eligendum regem; electionem fore periculosam.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z26"/>Electores imperii legatos miserunt pro filio <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>imperatoris, qui regnum illud ambit.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Fama iam <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>incipit hic increbescere <placeName ref="l272">Rupellae</placeName> ducem <lb xml:id="p1z29"/><persName>Aumalium</persName> una cum aliquot primatibus et praecipuis <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>bellatoribus esse interfectum a parte regis, cui <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>Hugonothi plurimum damni inferant et cladibus <lb xml:id="p1z32"/>omnia misceant suis fortissimis eruptionibus.</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z33"/>Laß sähen, ob gott den <placeName ref="l862">Eydgnossen</placeName> immerdar wölle <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>zuͦ<lb xml:id="p1z35"/>sähen und iren uner<lb xml:id="p1z36"/>hörten gydt, hochmuͦt und tratz, <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>gott und der wällt gebotten, vertragen.</s>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Iudex iustissimus <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>non aberrabit nec fallet.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">Hodie 8. dies est, quando <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>d. <persName ref="p8018">Hallerus</persName> noster tuas mihi communicavit.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Perinde est, <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>sive illi sive mihi scribas.</s>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="la">Tu vere in hac <pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>periculosa actione in hoc eris totus, ut iure et <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>iustitia res transigatur, non vi aut armata manu.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z3"/>Dominus ait "Iustitiam iuste exequaris."</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la">Dominum oro, <lb xml:id="p2z4"/>ut pacem concedat et iustitiae iustisque adsit.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Eun<lb xml:id="p2z5"/>dem oro, ut te consoletur et confirmet.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la">Ora vicissim <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>pro me dominum.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la">Miror, an libelli mei De per<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>sequtionibus ecclesiae vobis sint redditi et quid de ipso tu et a<lb xml:id="p2z8"/>lii viri boni iudicent.</s>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="la">Sis semper fortis et constans in domino.</s>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="la">Dominus dabit virtutem.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Vale una cum <lb xml:id="p2z9"/>tua familia, dominis et fratribus atque amicis, quos ordine salutabis.</s>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te mei.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="la">3. april<lb xml:id="p2z10"/>is 1573.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="la"><persName ref="p495">Bullingerus</persName> tuus.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="la">Pietate et eruditione praestantissimo viro d. <persName ref="p8016">Tobiae Iconio</persName>, <placeName ref="l98">Curiensis</placeName> eccles<lb xml:id="p2z11"/>iae pastori, domino meo honorando et fratri charissimo.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="de">An h. <persName ref="p8016">Thobia Eglin</persName>, pfarre<lb xml:id="p2z12"/>ren zuͦ <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> zuͦ S. Martin.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
